"@bdqjtggr1grfn66h946dhjh0ft": "a + b: the one + works part by part on points, directions, colours, or any record whose fields are all Float64s; plus is its old name, kept for a release. This module's operations and their names follow the built-in functions of GLSL and WGSL (influence), which a shader compiles them to.",
